"""Course exam, part A: lessons 1, 2, 5, 7, 10, 13, 16, 17, 18 and 19.

Every question here puts a lesson's idea in a situation the lesson did not
show: the library from another side, or a small new domain. An exam question
is written to be survived, so each one has a single defensible answer and a
`why` for every option.
"""

